<title>USA: WHX's Dynamics Corp tender expires.</title>
<headline>WHX's Dynamics Corp tender expires.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>WHX Corp said Monday that its cash tender offer for shares of Dynamics Corp of America at $56 a share expired, with 406,579 Dynamics shares tendered.</p>
<p>WHX now owns 516,440, or 13.5 percent, of the outstanding shares of common stock of Dynamics Corp.</p>
